  "question": {
    "text": "The ideal gas equation for 1 mol of ideal gas is&nbsp;PV = nRT<br />\rThe graph between P and T at constant volume, i.e. isochores are plotted as under<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/83e2bbb1-d991-4b3b-b1cc-3e4124e16fc1.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 116px; width: 150px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rWhich of the following order of volume is correct?",
